license: MIT
version: "0.22.0"
date-released: "2026-01-01"
abstract: "A free, browser-based web application for multi-objective Pareto analysis of drug-like molecules. Computes physicochemical properties, identifies Pareto-optimal subsets, and provides interactive analysis views. All computation runs client-side via RDKit.js WebAssembly. Optionally integrates ADMET-AI predictions via Chemprop D-MPNN."
keywords:
  - drug discovery
  - multi-objective optimization
  - Pareto analysis
  - cheminformatics
  - ADMET
  - RDKit
  - WebAssembly
